{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07429","headline":"送陆[澧]仓曹西上 · 刘长卿","name":"送陆[澧]仓曹西上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安此去欲何依，先达谁当荐陆机。\n日下凤翔双阙迥，雪中人去二陵稀。\n舟从故里难移棹，家住寒塘独掩扉。\n临水自伤流落久，赠君空有泪沾衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07429.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07429","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}